        "id": 235655,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-03-05T01:59:58.210Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The problem is that URL’s changed entirely.  So for instance, this:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-guide-to-serpent-slumbering-beneath-the-island-10888\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-guide-to-serpent-slumbering-beneath-the-island-10888</a></p>\n<p>Became this:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-guide-to-serpent-slumbering-beneath-the-island/17388\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-guide-to-serpent-slumbering-beneath-the-island/17388</a></p>\n<p>Which, in some cases, can be replaced easily, because <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-guide-to-serpent-slumbering-beneath-the-island/\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-guide-to-serpent-slumbering-beneath-the-island/</a> (without the ID number) works just fine.  I’m not sure that will work for all links, though.</p>\n<p>If no better solution comes up, you could do a find-replace with a few lines of code, depending on the backend.</p>",
